{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this solarpunk mystery, you are PIM, a space station control system programmed with a hidden agenda by your creator, Engineer Angela Sen: protect the mission and crew from sabotage. All the while, you must keep your illegal sentience secret and trust the right crew members, or you will be shut down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/extras/2981a71201a5b9b8dd9e8608c371eba1.poster.avif?t=1759246435\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/extras/2981a71201a5b9b8dd9e8608c371eba1.webm?t=1759246435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/extras/2981a71201a5b9b8dd9e8608c371eba1.mp4?t=1759246435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is 2066: thirty-six years after a record-smashing G6 geomagnetic storm disrupted the world\u2019s power supply and caused social, economic and political chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a decades-long period of rebuilding, the newly-formed World Space-Weather Science Consortium has designed and launched a space station to both deflect solar flares from Earth and harness clean energy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Named the First Moon of Mercury, this station has the hopes of the world population behind it, or so it is believed. Political factions have risen from the rubble, and they each have their own plans for the future of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/extras/e76cf9938d76322abe79b838f48d2b7f.poster.avif?t=1759246435\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/extras/e76cf9938d76322abe79b838f48d2b7f.webm?t=1759246435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/extras/e76cf9938d76322abe79b838f48d2b7f.mp4?t=1759246435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by 3D puzzle boxes, you must configure and link incoming modules to build the growing station. While building and solving station modules, unknown saboteurs will attempt to disrupt operations in underhanded ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To counteract these disruptions, a human crew member must authorize any changes you make to objectives. Who you trust with these changes will determine the success of the mission and your continued existence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe and protect the crew, identify both solar and human threats, and manipulate the station's intricate systems to continue the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/extras/55b3e2e53dcd012ec3bb369e16b31007.poster.avif?t=1759246435\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/extras/55b3e2e53dcd012ec3bb369e16b31007.webm?t=1759246435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/extras/55b3e2e53dcd012ec3bb369e16b31007.mp4?t=1759246435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Games by Stitch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We started with a vision that interactive stories combine distinct elements into something greater. Games by Stitch is an indie studio creating award-winning, thoughtful, story-driven games. Some of these games include Broken Spectre, Flow Weaver, Terrorarium, and Rival Books of Aster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Canadians, we are dedicated to promoting Canadian media, art, and games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006340?t=1759246435","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/6f2b9b500500d16ab7b071d396ca835f7266515b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759246435","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/5ae84179c11d145dc90cee68e992720cb9285524/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759246435","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/5ae84179c11d145dc90cee68e992720cb9285524/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759246435","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this solarpunk mystery, you are PIM, a space station control system programmed with a hidden agenda by your creator, Engineer Angela Sen: protect the mission and crew from sabotage. All the while, you must keep your illegal sentience secret and trust the right crew members, or you will be shut down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/extras/2981a71201a5b9b8dd9e8608c371eba1.poster.avif?t=1759246435\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/extras/2981a71201a5b9b8dd9e8608c371eba1.webm?t=1759246435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/extras/2981a71201a5b9b8dd9e8608c371eba1.mp4?t=1759246435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is 2066: thirty-six years after a record-smashing G6 geomagnetic storm disrupted the world\u2019s power supply and caused social, economic and political chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a decades-long period of rebuilding, the newly-formed World Space-Weather Science Consortium has designed and launched a space station to both deflect solar flares from Earth and harness clean energy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Named the First Moon of Mercury, this station has the hopes of the world population behind it, or so it is believed. Political factions have risen from the rubble, and they each have their own plans for the future of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/extras/e76cf9938d76322abe79b838f48d2b7f.poster.avif?t=1759246435\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/extras/e76cf9938d76322abe79b838f48d2b7f.webm?t=1759246435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/extras/e76cf9938d76322abe79b838f48d2b7f.mp4?t=1759246435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by 3D puzzle boxes, you must configure and link incoming modules to build the growing station. While building and solving station modules, unknown saboteurs will attempt to disrupt operations in underhanded ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To counteract these disruptions, a human crew member must authorize any changes you make to objectives. Who you trust with these changes will determine the success of the mission and your continued existence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe and protect the crew, identify both solar and human threats, and manipulate the station's intricate systems to continue the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/extras/55b3e2e53dcd012ec3bb369e16b31007.poster.avif?t=1759246435\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/extras/55b3e2e53dcd012ec3bb369e16b31007.webm?t=1759246435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/extras/55b3e2e53dcd012ec3bb369e16b31007.mp4?t=1759246435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Games by Stitch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We started with a vision that interactive stories combine distinct elements into something greater. Games by Stitch is an indie studio creating award-winning, thoughtful, story-driven games. Some of these games include Broken Spectre, Flow Weaver, Terrorarium, and Rival Books of Aster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Canadians, we are dedicated to promoting Canadian media, art, and games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Games by Stitch"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006340/a1a29a18685d24a0860b3f27b8b8b010752599c8/header.jpg?t=1759246435","is_free":false,"linux_